<mxCell id="why" value="A channel block that is identical across twenty&#xa;snapshots is stored once. That is why 45&#xa;snapshots fit in 11.75 MB instead of 60 MB, and&#xa;why renaming a channel on the desk does not&#xa;rewrite old snapshots." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5D574E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="222" width="340" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
